    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d907">

                <pb facs="0855" n="845" sameAs="frus:frus1941v05/pg845"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">893.102S/2454: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in China</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Johnson</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to
                        the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Chungking</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1941-04-08T09:00:00+07:00">April 8, 1941—9
                            a.m.</date>
                        <lb/> [Received April 8—5:20 a.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>My April 5, noon. Dr. Tuan Mao-lan<anchor n="95" xml:id="d907-f1"/> of the
                    Foreign Office called on me on the evening of April 7 and said that since it is
                    not clear what procedure will be adopted for selection of Chinese members of the
                    proposed provisional council he had been instructed to see me and make the
                    following oral statement on behalf Minister for Foreign Affairs. (See my April
                    8, 10 a.m.<anchor n="96" xml:id="d907-f2"/>)</p>
                <p>Sent to Shanghai, repeated to Department and Peiping.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Johnson</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d907-f1" n="95" xml:id="d907-f1-content">
                <p>Senior Secretary in the Chinese Ministry for Foreign Affairs.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d907-f2" n="96" xml:id="d907-f2-content">
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Infra</hi>.</p>
            </note>
